inkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI正式宣布暂停英国百亿级“星际之门”人工智能基础设施项目</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google Gemini 更新支持生成交互式 3D 模型与动态物理模拟场景</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">DeepSeek V4将于4月下旬发布，具备万亿参数并深度适配国产芯片</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里发布 Marco-Mini-Instruct 模型，基于 Upcycling 技术将 0.6B 模型升级为 17B MoE</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/96be815c6ac81d9ff05a839af2088d38.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里国际数字商业团队推出 Marco-Mini-Instruct 模型，该模型基于 Qwen3-0.6B-Base 通过 Upcycling 技术转化而来。其总参数量为 17.3B，激活参数量仅 0.86B（约 5%）。在 8bit 量化及 DDR4 2400 内存环境下，推理速度可达 30token/s，支持在普通 CPU 上流畅运行。该模型通过细粒度子矩阵切分与 Drop-Upcycling 策略实现架构升级，并采用级联 On-Policy Distillation 蒸馏技术，以 Qwen3-30B-A3B 及 Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B 为教师模型进行训练。性能实测显示，其在多数 benchmark 上超越了 Qwen3-4B 等 Dense 模型。该成果为开发者提供了低成本炼制 MoE 的新范</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">亚马逊拟对外销售自研AI芯片，年营收目标直指500亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9328331fc4efec5c1d3e01c7bac78499.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">亚马逊CEO安迪·贾西透露，公司正计划改变自研AI芯片商业策略，由仅通过AWS提供云算力租赁转向直接向第三方销售Trainium系列AI加速器及配套机架。此举旨在挑战英伟达的市场地位，并构建自主可控的全栈AI产业链。目前，亚马逊第二代AI芯片Trainium2性价比已较同类产品高出约30%，即将出货的Trainium3订阅率已接近满额。业内评估，若芯片部门独立运营并全面对外开放，其年化营收规模有望从目前的200亿美元提升至500亿美元。通过大规模销售自研芯片，亚马逊不仅能分摊研发成本、降低对英伟达GPU的依赖，还将为市场提供重要的算力替代方案，吸引对成本敏感的中小型AI创业者，从而缓解全球算力供应链压力并重塑AI硬件市场竞争格局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI正式宣布暂停英国百亿级“星际之门”人工智能基础设施项目</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2cb8beb2512d5a53b38af86ce5743167.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于4月9日宣布暂停其在英国的“星际之门”（Stargate）人工智能基础设施项目。该项目原计划建设超级算力中心，旨在支撑GPT-5等下一代大模型的算力需求。OpenAI官方指出，项目暂停的核心原因在于能源成本高企以及当地针对大型数据中心的监管政策存在不确定性，导致长期投资的商业预期受阻。尽管项目按下暂停键，OpenAI表示仍看好英国的AI发展潜力，并将在能源成本等条件改善后重新评估推进该项目的可能性。此次事件反映了当前AI产业在追求更高算力密度过程中，电力供应与政策环境已成为制约AGI基础设施落地的关键门槛。随着算力需求呈几何倍数增长，全球AI巨头正面临从算法竞争向能源主权与基建布局转型的严峻挑战。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google Gemini 更新支持生成交互式 3D 模型与动态物理模拟场景</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/96358e33484a36b16289902fb2285873.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google 近日为 Gemini AI 助手推出重磅更新，支持生成可旋转、可缩放的交互式 3D 模型及动态物理模拟场景。用户在询问涉及空间结构或物理规律的问题时，系统可生成三维可视化内容，如“月球绕地公转”或“双摆系统”。该功能支持 360 度多维旋转观察，并提供滑块与开关等交互控件，允许用户实时调节重力参数、运动速度等变量，直观观察物理过程变化。目前，所有 Gemini Pro 用户均可通过点击界面下方的“Show me the visualization”按钮开启体验。此次升级标志着 AI 交互模式从纯文本向多模态、高交互的空间智能进化，进一步强化了 Google 在可视化答案领域的竞争优势，显著降低了用户理解复杂科学概念的学习门槛。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek V4将于4月下旬发布，具备万亿参数并深度适配国产芯片</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6ca0f6dcfd591ce7eab8b704bf6cf8af.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">DeepSeek创始人梁文锋确认，新一代旗舰大模型DeepSeek V4定于2026年4月下旬发布。该模型参数规模达到万亿级，并支持百万级上下文窗口。技术核心亮点在于首次实现与华为昇腾等国产芯片的深度适配，标志着国产大模型在摆脱CUDA生态依赖、构建自主算力底座方面取得关键进展。为迎接V4发布，DeepSeek网页端已上线“快速模式”与“专家模式”进行实战预演。受此战略布局影响，国内算力市场需求激增，阿里巴巴、字节跳动、腾讯等巨头已预订数十万片新一代AI芯片，带动相关芯片价格上涨约20%。DeepSeek V4的发布不仅提升了模型推理的成本效能比，也为国产大模型在算力受限背景下提供了可持续的增长路径，推动行业竞争向“模型+算力+生态”全维度演进。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
